  "title": "Sammy's Stuffed Bell Peppers",
  "description": "Bell peppers are stuffed with a simple mixture of beef, rice, and onion, then baked until tender. Leftover filling can be used to make a quick pasta sauce, or served with hamburger buns as a sloppy joe alternative.",
  "authors": [
